{"suttaId":"tha-ap395","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[12229,12314],"vripara":"304"},"segments":{"tha-ap395:0.3":"Sabbakittikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap395:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jalitaṃ [jotantaṃ (sī.)],","tha-ap395:1.2":"dīparukkhaṃva ujjalaṃ [jotitaṃ (syā.)];","tha-ap395:1.3":"Osadhiṃva virocantaṃ,","tha-ap395:1.4":"vijjutaṃ gagane yathā. 305.","tha-ap395:2.1":"“Asambhītaṃ anuttāsiṃ,","tha-ap395:2.2":"migarājaṃva kesariṃ;","tha-ap395:2.3":"Ñāṇālokaṃ pakāsentaṃ,","tha-ap395:2.4":"maddantaṃ titthiye gaṇe. 306.","tha-ap395:3.1":"“Uddharantaṃ imaṃ lokaṃ, chiddantaṃ sabbasaṃsayaṃ;","tha-ap395:3.3":"Gajjantaṃ [asambhītaṃ (syā.), gacchantaṃ (ka.)] migarājaṃva,","tha-ap395:3.4":"addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ. 307.","tha-ap395:4.1":"“Jaṭājinadharo āsiṃ,","tha-ap395:4.2":"brahā uju patāpavā;","tha-ap395:4.3":"Vākacīraṃ gahetvāna,","tha-ap395:4.4":"pādamūle apatthariṃ. 308.","tha-ap395:5.1":"“Kāḷānusāriyaṃ gayha,","tha-ap395:5.2":"anulimpiṃ tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap395:5.3":"Sambuddhamanulimpetvā,","tha-ap395:5.4":"santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ. 309.","tha-ap395:6.1":"“Samuddharasimaṃ lokaṃ,","tha-ap395:6.2":"oghatiṇṇa [oghatiṇṇo (syā. ka.)] mahāmuni;","tha-ap395:6.3":"Ñāṇālokena jotesi,","tha-ap395:6.4":"nāvaṭaṃ [pavaraṃ (syā.), vajira (pī.)] ñāṇamuttamaṃ. 310.","tha-ap395:7.1":"“Dhammacakkaṃ [tuvaṃ cakkaṃ (ka.)] pavattesi,","tha-ap395:7.2":"maddase paratitthiye;","tha-ap395:7.3":"Usabho jitasaṅgāmo,","tha-ap395:7.4":"sampakampesi medaniṃ. 311.","tha-ap395:8.1":"“Mahāsamudde ūmiyo,","tha-ap395:8.2":"velantamhi pabhijjare;","tha-ap395:8.3":"Tatheva tava ñāṇamhi,","tha-ap395:8.4":"sabbadiṭṭhī pabhijjare. 312.","tha-ap395:9.1":"“Sukhumacchikajālena,","tha-ap395:9.2":"saramhi sampatānite;","tha-ap395:9.3":"Antojālikatā [jālagatā (sī.)] pāṇā,","tha-ap395:9.4":"pīḷitā honti tāvade. 313.","tha-ap395:10.1":"“Tatheva titthiyā loke,","tha-ap395:10.2":"puthupāsaṇḍanissitā [mūḷhā saccavinissaṭā (syā.), muṭṭhasaccavinissaṭā (ka.)];","tha-ap395:10.3":"Antoñāṇavare tuyhaṃ,","tha-ap395:10.4":"parivattanti mārisa. 314.","tha-ap395:11.1":"“Patiṭṭhā vuyhataṃ oghe,","tha-ap395:11.2":"tvañhi nātho abandhunaṃ;","tha-ap395:11.3":"Bhayaṭṭitānaṃ saraṇaṃ,","tha-ap395:11.4":"muttitthīnaṃ parāyaṇaṃ. 315.","tha-ap395:12.1":"“Ekavīro asadiso,","tha-ap395:12.2":"mettākaruṇasañcayo [saññuto (syā.)];","tha-ap395:12.3":"Asamo susamo santo [susīlo asamo santo (sī.), paññavā yuttacāgo ca (syā.)],","tha-ap395:12.4":"vasī tādī jitañjayo. 316.","tha-ap395:13.1":"“Dhīro vigatasammoho,","tha-ap395:13.2":"anejo akathaṃkathī;","tha-ap395:13.3":"Tusito [vusito (sī.)] vantadososi,","tha-ap395:13.4":"nimmalo saṃyato suci. 317.","tha-ap395:14.1":"“Saṅgātigo hatamado [gatamado (syā.), tamanudo (ka.)],","tha-ap395:14.2":"tevijjo tibhavantago;","tha-ap395:14.3":"Sīmātigo dhammagaru,","tha-ap395:14.4":"gatattho hitavabbhuto [hitavappatho (sī. syā.)]. 318.","tha-ap395:15.1":"“Tārako tvaṃ yathā nāvā,","tha-ap395:15.2":"nidhīvassāsakārako;","tha-ap395:15.3":"Asambhīto yathā sīho,","tha-ap395:15.4":"gajarājāva dappito. 319.","tha-ap395:16.1":"“Thometvā dasagāthāhi,","tha-ap395:16.2":"padumuttaraṃ mahāyasaṃ;","tha-ap395:16.3":"Vanditvā satthuno pāde,","tha-ap395:16.4":"tuṇhī aṭṭhāsahaṃ tadā. 320.","tha-ap395:17.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū,","tha-ap395:17.2":"āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap395:17.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā,","tha-ap395:17.4":"imā gāthā abhāsatha. 321.","tha-ap395:18.1":"“‘Yo me sīlañca ñāṇañca,","tha-ap395:18.2":"saddhammañcāpi vaṇṇayi [dhammañcāpi pakittayi (sī. syā.)];","tha-ap395:18.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi,","tha-ap395:18.4":"suṇātha mama bhāsato. 322.","tha-ap395:19.1":"“‘Saṭṭhi kappasahassāni,","tha-ap395:19.2":"devaloke ramissati;","tha-ap395:19.3":"Aññe devebhibhavitvā,","tha-ap395:19.4":"issaraṃ kārayissati. 323.","tha-ap395:20.1":"“‘So pacchā pabbajitvāna,","tha-ap395:20.2":"sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap395:20.3":"Gotamassa bhagavato,","tha-ap395:20.4":"sāsane pabbajissati. 324.","tha-ap395:21.1":"“‘Pabbajitvāna kāyena,","tha-ap395:21.2":"pāpakammaṃ vivajjiya;","tha-ap395:21.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya,","tha-ap395:21.4":"nibbāyissatināsavo’. 325.","tha-ap395:22.1":"“Yathāpi megho thanayaṃ,","tha-ap395:22.2":"tappeti mediniṃ imaṃ;","tha-ap395:22.3":"Tatheva tvaṃ mahāvīra,","tha-ap395:22.4":"dhammena tappayī mamaṃ. 326.","tha-ap395:23.1":"“Sīlaṃ paññañca dhammañca,","tha-ap395:23.2":"thavitvā lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap395:23.3":"Pattomhi paramaṃ santiṃ,","tha-ap395:23.4":"nibbānaṃ padamaccutaṃ. 327.","tha-ap395:24.1":"“Aho nūna sa bhagavā,","tha-ap395:24.2":"ciraṃ tiṭṭheyya cakkhumā;","tha-ap395:24.3":"Aññātañca vijāneyyuṃ,","tha-ap395:24.4":"phuseyyuṃ [aññātañcāpi jāneyya, passeyya (ka.)] amataṃ padaṃ. 328.","tha-ap395:25.1":"“Ayaṃ me pacchimā jāti,","tha-ap395:25.2":"bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap395:25.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya,","tha-ap395:25.4":"viharāmi anāsavo. 329.","tha-ap395:26.1":"“Satasahassito kappe,","tha-ap395:26.2":"yaṃ buddhamabhithomayiṃ","tha-ap395:26.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap395:26.4":"kittanāya idaṃ phalaṃ. 330.","tha-ap395:27.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ,","tha-ap395:27.2":"bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap395:27.3":"Sabbāsavā parikkhīṇā,","tha-ap395:27.4":"natthi dāni punabbhavo. 331.","tha-ap395:28.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe…","tha-ap395:28.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. 332.","tha-ap395:29.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","tha-ap395:29.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap395:30.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sabbakittiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap395:31.1":"Sabbakittikattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ. 4."},"unsure":["tha-ap395:3.1"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":1734,"to":1742,"paras":[{"para":1734,"vripara":"308","refs":["tha-ap395:5"],"lines":["<b>Paṭipannā</b>ti catumaggasamaṅgino ca <b>phalaṭṭhā</b> arahattaphale ṭhitā ca <b>sekhā phalasamaṅgino</b> heṭṭhimehi tīhi phalehi samannāgatā ca ete aṭṭha ariyabhikkhū, <b>uttamatthaṃ</b> nibbānaṃ <b>āsīsakā</b> gavesakā, <b>taṃ</b> paññavantaṃ <b>parivārenti sadā</b> sabbakālaṃ sevanti bhajanti payirupāsantīti attho. 310."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:5"]]},{"para":1735,"vripara":"310","refs":["tha-ap395:7"],"lines":["Kāyavedanācittadhammānupassanāsaṅkhātānaṃ catunnaṃ satipaṭṭhānānaṃ <b>kusalā</b> chekā satisambojjhaṅgādīnaṃ sattannaṃ sambojjhaṅgānaṃ <b>bhāvanāya</b>vaḍḍhanāya<b> ratā</b> allīnā. 314."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:7"]]},{"para":1737,"vripara":null,"refs":["tha-ap395:7"],"lines":["<b>Uḷurājāva</b> tārakarājā iva ca sobhasi. 315."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:7"]]},{"para":1738,"vripara":"315","refs":["tha-ap395:12"],"lines":["Rukkhapabbataratanasattādayo dhāretīti dharaṇī, dharaṇiyaṃ ruhā sañjātā vaḍḍhitā cāti <b>dharaṇīruhā</b> rukkhā.","Pathaviyaṃ patiṭṭhāya <b>ruhanti</b> vaḍḍhanti vuddhiṃ virūḷhiṃ āpajjanti.","<b>Vepullataṃ</b> vipulabhāvaṃ paripūrabhāvaṃ <b>pāpuṇanti, te</b> rukkhā kamena <b>phalaṃ dassayanti</b> phaladhārino honti. 317-9."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:12"],["tha-ap395:12"],["tha-ap395:12"]]},{"para":1739,"vripara":"317-319","refs":["tha-ap395:14"],"lines":["Punapi bhagavantameva thomento <b>sindhu sarassatī</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha sindhuvādi nāma gaṅgā ca sarassatī nāma gaṅgā ca nandiyagaṅgā ca candabhāgāgaṅgā ca gaṅgā nāma gaṅgā ca yamunā nāma gaṅgā ca sarabhū nāma gaṅgā ca mahī nāma gaṅgā ca.","<b>Sandamānānaṃ</b> gacchantīnaṃ <b>etāsaṃ</b> gaṅgānaṃ <b>sāgarova</b> samuddo eva <b>sampaṭicchati</b> paṭiggaṇhāti dhāreti.","Tadā etā sabbagaṅgā <b>purimaṃ nāmaṃ</b> sindhuvādigaṅgātyādikaṃ purimaṃ nāmapaññattivohāraṃ <b>jahanti</b> chaḍḍenti <b>sāgaroteva</b> sāgaro iti eva <b>ñāyati</b> pākaṭā bhavati yathā.","<b>Tatheva</b> tathā eva <b>ime</b> <b>catubbaṇṇā</b> khattiyabrāhmaṇavessasuddasaṅkhātā cattāro kulā <b>tavantike</b> tava antike samīpe <b>pabbajitvā</b> pattakāsāyacīvaradhārino paricarantā <b>purimaṃ nāmaṃ</b> khattiyādināmadheyyaṃ paññattivohāraṃ <b>jahanti</b> cajanti, <b>buddhaputtāti</b> buddhassa orasāti <b>ñāyare</b> pākaṭā bhaveyyuṃ. 320-4."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:14"],["tha-ap395:14"],["tha-ap395:14"],["tha-ap395:14"],["tha-ap395:14"]]},{"para":1740,"vripara":"320-324","refs":["tha-ap395:17"],"lines":["<b>Cando</b> candamaṇḍalo abbhā mahikā rajo dhumo rāhūti pañcahi upakkilesehi virahitattā <b>vimalo</b> vigatamalo nimmalo, <b>ākāsadhātuyā</b> ākāsagabbhe <b>gacchaṃ</b> gacchanto, <b>sabbe</b> tārakasamūhe ābhāya maddamāno loke <b>atirocati</b> daddallati yathā.","<b>Tatheva</b> tathā eva tvaṃ…pe…. 325-7."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:17"],["tha-ap395:17"]]},{"para":1741,"vripara":"325-327","refs":["tha-ap395:22"],"lines":["<b>Udake jātā</b> udake saṃvaḍḍhā kumudā mandālakā ca <b>bahū</b> saṅkhātikkantā, <b>toyena</b> udakena kaddamakalalena ca <b>upalimpanti</b> allīyanti yathā, tatheva <b>bahukā sattā</b> aparimāṇā sattā loke <b>jātā</b> saṃvaḍḍhā rāgena ca dosena ca <b>aṭṭitā</b> bandhitā <b>virūhare</b> viruhanti.","Kaddame kumudaṃ yathā viruhati sañjāyati.","<b>Kesarī</b>ti padumaṃ. 329-30."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:22"],["tha-ap395:22"],["tha-ap395:22"]]},{"para":1742,"vripara":"329-330","refs":["tha-ap395:26"],"lines":["<b>Rammake māse</b>ti kattikamāse “komudiyā cātumāsiniyā”ti vuttattā.","<b>Vārijā</b> padumapupphādayo <b>bahū</b> pupphā <b>pupphanti</b> vikasanti, <b>taṃ māsaṃ</b> taṃ kattikamāsaṃ nātivattanti vārijāti sambandho.","<b>Samayo pupphanāya so</b>ti so kattikamāso pupphanāya vikasanāya samayo kāloti attho.","Yathā pupphanti tatheva tvaṃ, sakyaputta, <b>pupphito</b> vikasito asi.","<b>Pupphito te vimuttiyā</b>ti te tuyhaṃ sissā katasambhārā bhikkhū vimuttiyā arahattaphalañāṇena pupphito vikasito.","Yathā vārijaṃ padumaṃ pupphanasamayaṃ nātikkamati, tathā te sāsanaṃ ovādānusāsaniṃ <b>nātivattanti</b> nātikkamantīti attho. 333-4."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap395:26"],["tha-ap395:26"],["tha-ap395:26"],["tha-ap395:26"],["tha-ap395:26"],["tha-ap395:26"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
